{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Google 多項服務今天早上出現故障，身處歐盟或英國的用戶可能無法正常上網。</p><h3>DNS 雲端及廣告服務受影響</h3><p>故障涵蓋 DNS、雲端及廣告投放，Google 各項服務均出現問題，美國則未受影響。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3dc4f237a1706b5f078cb35cd81fa5743cb72af9473315d3db46111e8395bb50/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F923a2d002fdfd9a54faa044dadaf7d75.jpg\"/><p>Screenshot</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/edc6649f8a3a69169c9864d953df90ac0385d13ee816144920bef9b562028623/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F11e3e62d9e23f1a1bac006382544eab1.jpg\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:52.097793+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":2,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:24:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:18:11.048091+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:03.038375+00:00","content_hash":"8f63145d1ac8ac6c95eafc3e0a79a1a8968924d44bb43c5a1f8474c28e118d46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}